rted there are left out.","Diluted EPS by quarter as reported in the 10-Qs; fourth quarters are calculated (net income ÷ estimated diluted shares) because EPS does not add across quarters.","Percentages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding."],"report":{"summary":["Peoples Bancorp is the holding company for Peoples Bank, which provides banking services to individuals and businesses. Revenue (net interest income plus noninterest income) rose 2.5% to $459M in 2025. Net interest income rose 1.9% to $355M and noninterest income rose 4.7% to $104M; noninterest expense rose 3.1%, and the provision for credit losses was $42.2M, versus $24.8M.","Net income to common fell 8.9% to $106M, or $2.99 per diluted share, and the efficiency ratio was 61.5% versus 61.1%. Peoples Bancorp returned $61.5M through dividends and buybacks."],"highlights":["Revenue rose 2.5% to $459M.","Net interest income rose 1.9%.","Noninterest income rose 4.7% to $104M.","Net loans rose 6.1% to $6.7B."],"watch":["Net income to common fell 8.9% to $106M.","Efficiency ratio worsened to 61.5%.","Credit-loss provision rose 70.1% to $42.2M.","Net interest income depends on interest rates."],"table":[["Total revenue",0.4593,0.4481,1],["Net interest income",0.3552,0.3487],["Noninterest income",0.1041,0.0994],["Noninterest expense",0.2823,0.2738],["Provision for credit losses",0.0422,0.0248],["Pre-tax income",0.1348,0.1495,1],["Income tax",0.028,0.0323],["Preferred dividends & other",-0.001,0.001],["Net income to common",0.1058,0.1162,1],["Diluted EPS ($)",2.99,3.31,0,"eps"],["Book value per share ($)",34.527376,31.992834,0,"eps"]],"sources":[["Peoples Bancorp Inc. Form 10-K filings (SEC EDGAR)","https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000318300&type=10-K"],["Peoples Bancorp financial statements (StockAnalysis)","https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/pebo/financials/"]]},"video":{"revenueLine":{"cap":"Net interest income was 77% of revenue.","say":"Net interest income made up 77